sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Trader
    participant CD as CyberDeltaEngine
    participant RM as Risk Management
    participant BP as Backpack API (CEX)
    participant HL as Hyperliquid (Arbitrum)
    participant PX as Paradex (StarkNet)
    participant RF as rhino.fi Bridge
    participant FB as Fallback Bridge (e.g., Across)
    participant ETH as Ethereum L1
    participant Wallet as L1/L2 Wallet

    Note over CD,Wallet: Enhanced Collateral Transfer Process (Detailed Flow)

    %% Initialization with Pre-Positioning and Caching
    Note over RM: Initialization and Collateral Check Phase
    RM->>RM: Predict C_target^BP, C_target^HL, C_target^PX using ML (E[C_needed] + σ_C)
    RM->>BP: Get balance (ED25519-signed, cached if t_now - t_cache < 5min)
    BP-->>RM: C_current^BP (or cached value if API fails)
    RM->>HL: Get balance (REST, cached if t_now - t_cache < 5min)
    HL-->>RM: C_current^HL (or cached value if API fails)
    RM->>PX: Get balance (REST, cached if t_now - t_cache < 5min)
    PX-->>RM: C_current^PX (or cached value if API fails)
    RM->>RM: Check imbalance with tolerance: |C_current - C_target| < 0.02 * C_target
    Note right of RM: Example: C_target^HL = $100k, C_current^HL = $97k, within 2% OK

    %% Transfer Decision with Dynamic Pathing
    alt Significant Imbalance: |C_current^HL - C_target^HL| > threshold
        Note over RM: Transfer Decision Phase
        RM->>RM: Calculate transfer size: ΔC = C_target - C_current
        RM->>RM: Optimize path: Cost = α * Fees + β * Time + γ * Risk
        Note right of RM: Fees = API_Fee + Gas, Time = t_exec + t_confirm, Risk = f(liquidity, reliability)
        RM->>RM: Prioritize by urgency: Priority = w_urgency * t_deadline
        Note right of RM: Example: t_deadline = 1h for funding rate capture

        %% Option 1: Direct CEX → L2 Transfer (Enhanced with Batching)
        opt Direct Path (BP → HL)
            Note over RM,HL: Direct Path: BP → HL
            RM->>RM: Split transfer: n_chunks = ΔC / $50k
            RM->>RM: Generate ED25519 signatures for each chunk
            RM->>BP: Batch withdrawal requests (parallel, signed)
            BP-->>RM: Multiple tx_ids (e.g., 3 chunks of $30k each)
            loop Monitor Each Withdrawal (1-5min)
                RM->>BP: Check status (signed request)
                BP-->>RM: Status: pending → initiated
            end
            BP->>ETH: Submit batched txs to Arbitrum bridge
            Note right of ETH: 15-30 confirmations, ~3-5min total
            ETH->>HL: Bridge to Arbitrum
            loop Monitor Arbitrum Deposit (1-3min)
                RM->>HL: Check deposit status (REST)
                HL-->>RM: Status: pending → confirmed (2/3 validators)
            end
            HL-->>Wallet: USDC credited to L2 wallet
            RM->>HL: Deposit to exchange (contract call)
            HL-->>RM: Deposit confirmed
            alt Bridge Delay > 10min
                RM->>HL: Borrow ΔC temporarily (on-exchange)
                HL-->>RM: Borrowing confirmed
            end
            RM->>RM: Update C_current^BP -= ΔC, C_current^HL += ΔC
            RM->>CD: Notify: Transfer BP→HL complete
            CD->>User: Dashboard: "BP→HL: $90k transferred, 8min"

        %% Option 2: Multi-Bridge Transfer (BP → PX)
        opt Bridge Path (BP → RF/FB → PX)
            Note over RM,PX: Bridge Path: BP → PX via rhino.fi or Across
            RM->>BP: Withdraw ΔC to L1 (signed request)
            BP-->>RM: tx_id
            loop Monitor Withdrawal (5-30min)
                RM->>BP: Check status (signed)
                BP-->>RM: Status update
            end
            BP->>ETH: Submit to L1
            ETH-->>Wallet: USDC on L1
            RM->>RF: GET /bridge/liquidity (API_KEY)
            RF-->>RM: L_available^RF
            RM->>FB: GET /bridge/liquidity (API_KEY)
            FB-->>RM: L_available^FB
            alt L_available^RF > ΔC * 1.1
                RM->>RF: POST /bridge/quote & commit (API_KEY)
                Wallet->>RF: Sign & send tx
                RF->>PX: Bridge to StarkNet (5-15min)
            else L_available^FB > ΔC * 1.1
                RM->>FB: POST /bridge/quote & commit (API_KEY)
                Wallet->>FB: Sign & send tx
                FB->>PX: Bridge to StarkNet (5-15min)
            else Insufficient Liquidity
                RM->>CD: Alert: "Bridge liquidity low, manual action"
            end
            loop Check StarkNet Status (5-15min)
                RM->>PX: Query status (REST)
                PX-->>RM: Confirmed
            end
            RM->>PX: Deposit to exchange
            PX-->>RM: Confirmed
            RM->>RM: Update C_current^BP -= ΔC, C_current^PX += ΔC
            RM->>CD: Notify: Transfer BP→PX complete
            CD->>User: Dashboard: "BP→PX: $90k transferred, 12min"

        %% Option 3: L2-to-L2 Transfer (HL → PX)
        opt L2-to-L2 Path (HL → PX via Hop/Orbiter)
            Note over RM,PX: L2-to-L2 Path: HL → PX
            RM->>HL: Withdraw ΔC to L2 bridge (1 USDC fee)
            HL-->>Wallet: Funds bridged to Hop/Orbiter
            Wallet->>PX: Deposit via L2 bridge (5-10min)
            loop Check Status (5-10min)
                RM->>PX: Query status (REST)
                PX-->>RM: Confirmed
            end
            RM->>PX: Deposit to exchange
            PX-->>RM: Confirmed
            RM->>RM: Update C_current^HL -= ΔC, C_current^PX += ΔC
            RM->>CD: Notify: Transfer HL→PX complete
            CD->>User: Dashboard: "HL→PX: $90k transferred, 9min"
        end
    end

    %% Error Handling with Automation
    alt Transfer Failure or Timeout
        Note over RM: Error Handling Phase
        RM->>RM: Log failure: "BP→HL failed, tx_id: xyz"
        loop Retry (max 3 attempts)
            RM->>RM: Reduce size: Retry_Size = ΔC / 2^n, n = retry_count
            RM->>RM: Switch path (e.g., RF if direct fails)
            RM->>BP: Retry transfer (signed)
            BP-->>RM: Status: success or fail
            alt Success
                RM->>CD: Notify: "Retry succeeded"
                break
            else Fail
                RM->>CD: Alert: "Manual intervention needed"
            end
        end
        RM->>BP: Reconcile balance (signed)
        BP-->>RM: C_actual^BP
        RM->>HL: Reconcile balance
        HL-->>RM: C_actual^HL
        RM->>PX: Reconcile balance
        PX-->>RM: C_actual^PX
        RM->>RM: Update C_current with C_actual
    end

    %% Post-Transfer Adjustment
    Note over CD,PX: Post-Transfer Adjustment Phase
    RM->>RM: Adjust positions during transfer: w_t = w_target * (C_current / C_target)
    RM->>RM: Recalculate available capital: C_available = ∑ C_current^i
    RM->>RM: Update Kelly sizing: f* = (π - Costs) / σ^2
    RM-->>CD: Updated parameters
    CD->>User: Real-time dashboard: PnL, ETA = t_start + t_pred, Gas Alerts